<title>UK: SBC Jersey sets $300 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>SBC Jersey sets $300 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SBC JERSEY</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    09.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9975  PAY DATE    09.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.81     SPREAD	FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JER</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT NOVEMBER 1999 U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
